(Probe: file handle opened inside if/otherwise, used from a function
 and from main-line code after the branch)

a number called x is 1.

if x is 1 then,
  Open a file for writing called out at 1.
Otherwise,
  Open a file for writing called out at 1.

To speak.
  write "from function\n" to out.

speak.
